* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RMPRJOB - Submit Print Job
*
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
* gw  93-02-19           created
* mrs 93-07-30 s(999999) different logon if NSC is installed or not
* gw  93-10-07 s(999999) substitution variables USER, REPORT and BUNDLE
*                        in jobcards
* gw  94-02-24 s(999999) correct error handling
* gw  94-03-10 s(999999) pass G-NPR-USERID to print program for ESY logon
* gw  94-05-11 s(999999) ALL = TRUE for BS2000 printers
* gw  94-05-13 s(999999) logon with po-esy-userid
* mrs 94-05-16 s(999999) logon to esy in rmscprnt (subtak and print job)
* mrs 94-05-17 s(999999) use monitor job-variables if possible (BS2000)
* mrs 94-05-18 s(999999) reset g-p-jobname (BS2000)
* mrs 94-05-20 s(999999) follow-printout added
* gw  94-06-15 s(999999) correct status when jobcard missing
* gw  94-06-15 p(136331) NAT1320 in RLISLM line 3130
* gw  95-11-06 s(222119) change field length FCB fro 4 to 8
* gw  96-01-30 s(999999) print optimization under BS2000
* gw  96-06-11 s(999999) user exit to allow modification of substitution
* gw  96-10-18 s(999999) spool attribtes overwritten in print bundle
* mwi 97-06-10 p(162737) spool-attr account-number
* jwo 97-11-13 p(167263) add active reports exit
* gw  98-03-24 s(279421) sort reports by repname-rnb within group-seqno
*                        new superde BC-BUNDLE-RNB-GROUP-SEQNO-REPRNB
*                        if not present (NAT3061) we use the old one
* jvd 98-05-01 P(171055) Unable to pass Report Name in JCL
* gw  98-05-20 p(171055) avoid double esc-char in variables
* gw  98-06-08 s(788896) recform=(F,N) should be (F,A) for ASA cc.
* gw  98-07-16 p(172297) recat for build list active bundle redesign
*                        to include prerequisites
* jvd 98-09-10 p(164220) NOM141ÖNAT23
* gw  98-11-02 s(164220) 5 byte dbid /fnr
* jvd 99-03-24 r(308382) Add steplibs for environment without security.
* sju 99-05-06 p(182497) avoid parm truncation by writing 2 lines for
*                        each bundle report
* sju 99-09-17 p(186748) take USER from PO-ATTRIBUTES in preference to
*                        PO-USERID
* jvd 99-11-10 p(188713) Add steplibs for environment without security.
*                      for bundles also remove all comments pre 97
* sju 99-12-29 p(190545) Pass parms to RMPRBU in the correct sequence
* sju 00-01-20 p(190902) NAT0080 because only a . is written
* sju 00-02-03 p(191731) Pass parms to RMPRRP in the correct sequence
* sju 00-03-24 p(191368) monitor multitasking
* xsisgg 00-05-31 p(191312) Sort reports in bundle - take out old code
* xsiszha 2000-08-15 (CE7461) Extend Report and Bundle Names
* sju 00-09-22 p(201421) give NOM0707 if all reports in bundle are empty
* sju 01-04-20 p(208757) User-exit to decide old or new sequence
* xsetggr 01-06-15 p(209875) consequent adding of steplibd if NSC is not
*                            active
* sju     2002-03-21 p(221908) Correct STEPLIB handling
* sju     2002-05-16 p(223898) Corrections for print to DISKMVS
* fhi     2002-06-13 s(225125) Add email notificaton, NOMEX010
* sju     2002-07-10 p(226070) Extra variables
* sju     2002-07-18 nom221    More entries in RMJBST-P
* sju     2002-10-08 nom221    XML printers
* xsetggr 03-05-13 p(241727) change substitution of &COPIES for BS2 prin
* fhi     2003-07-23 p(242064) Unify steplib concatentation
* sju     2003-12-15 p(248535) Default print class not taken
* xsetggr 2004-03-10 p(250355) Default recfm,lrecl not taken
* sju     2004-04-22 p(250355) Correct handling of recfm, lrecl
* sju     2005-02-04 NOM31     NAT00021 instead of CMQ
* sju     05-03-04 NOM31      Correct p(248535) for multi-step printouts
* xsetggr 2007-05-03 NOM3201 support 5 byte node numbers
* xsetggr 2007-05-03 NOM3201 support P11 format run numbers
* fhi     2008-02-27 P302167   Binary printing in BS2000
* fhi     2008-03-19 P303113   RSTEPLIB still used if P297047 applied
* fhi     2008-07-24 P307319   restow due to changes in DDM NRM-BUNDLE-CONTENTS
* fhi     2009-02-27 P300323 Rename RGETSTEP to NOMGSTEP delivered in SYSTEM
* fhi     2009-05-20 N3463     Restow due to extended metadata
* fhi     2009-12-04 P321566   Add trace facilities, no trace to rep 1
* xsetggr 2010-03-15 P307403   corrupted printouts with separation pages
* xsetggr 2010-08-20 NOMALL-824 corect handling of separator printing
* fhi     2010-09-03 NOMALL-97 Extend message line
* xsetggr 2010-11-15 NOMALL-865 restow due to changes in EOMPHTYE
* fhi     2011-01-12 NOMALL-940 NAT1305 in line 80xx, correct 2007-05-03
* fhi     2011-02-09 NOMALL-926 Add trace-statements
* fhi     2011-02-16 NOMALL-926 Correct BPRINTD card in VSE
* fhi     2011-02-17 NOMALL-926 Correct Separator Linesize
* raya     2012-11-29 NOMALL-1214 check cat date of nomex*
* raya     2013-05-09 NOMALL-1214 backout check cat date of nomex*
* SU1     2016-08-01 NOMALL-1518 NOM3.5 deactivate opt.Compiler
* fhi     2016-11-15 NOMALL-1961 Use new task IDs
* fhi     2017-03-31 NOMALL-2009 Improve RDC handling
* SU2     2017-09-26 NOMALL-1823 NOM 3.5: remove CONNECT,ECL,XML
* SU3     2020-06-22 NOMALL-2349 show full msg
* SU4     2020-11-10 NOMALL-2440 split DDM -> NRM-MF-NODES
* SU5     2022-11-11 NOMALL-2579 BS2 fill var FULL for BS2 SYSOUT
